1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,406
MIRA: You said you cleaned!

2
00:00:01,406 --> 00:00:02,267
DEV: I did!

3
00:00:02,467 --> 00:00:04,075
MIRA: Everything's under the couch!

4
00:00:04,205 --> 00:00:05,534
DEV: The floor is clean.

5
00:00:05,684 --> 00:00:06,709
MIRA: And the cupboard?

6
00:00:06,709 --> 00:00:07,634
DEV: Closed.

7
00:00:07,709 --> 00:00:09,130
MIRA: Clean means THIS.

8
00:00:09,610 --> 00:00:10,870
DEV: Oh. THAT clean.

9
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:11,942
DEV: Done!

10
00:00:13,572 --> 00:00:15,442
Software teams write this list first.

11
00:00:15,442 --> 00:00:17,712
It's called acceptance criteria.

12
00:00:18,912 --> 00:00:21,563
JO: Why is all your stuff on my bed?

13
00:00:21,563 --> 00:00:22,913
DEV: It wasn't on the list.
